000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TMODFRET.
000400 AUTHOR.              LYNN M. BUNN / BARBARA WINTER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        FEBRUARY 26, 1982.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*                REWRITTEN APRIL 1985 TO COMBINE AKRON AND
001100*                SUBPLANTS VERSIONS.  -BARBARA WINTER.
001200*************************************************************
001300*************************************************************
001400**                  T M O D F R E T                        **
001500**                                                         **
001600**     MAIN PROGRAM FOR MODIFYING FREIGHT INFORMATION.     **
001700**                                                         **
001800**     THIS PROGRAM OPENS DATABASE, FORMFILE, TERMINAL,    **
001900**     ETC. AND DOES ANY INITIALIZING THAT IS NEEDED.      **
002000**     IT THEN CALLS THE SUBPROGRAM THAT DOES THE ACTUAL   **
002100**     PROCESSING.                                         **
002200**                                                         **
002300**     SPECIAL CHECKS:                                     **
002400**          1.  AKRON PLANT - VALIDATE USERS AND DEPT.     **
002500*************************************************************
002600*************************************************************
002700**                     FILES                               **
002800**     INPUT:                                              **
002900**          1.  VALIDRCV.PUB - VALID RECEIVING DOCKS       **
003000**                             AND DEPARTMENTS (AKRON ONLY)**
003100**              NOTE:  THIS TABLES FOR THIS FILE ONLY HAS  **
003200**                     ROOM FOR 40 RECORDS.                **
003300*************************************************************
003400*                HISTORY OF PROGRAM CHANGES                 *
003500*************************************************************
005200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
005500 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
005600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
005700 FILE-CONTROL.
005600     SELECT USER-FILE    ASSIGN TO DATABASE-VALIDRCV
                               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MPLTINFO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

005800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

006000
006100 FD  USER-FILE
006200     RECORD CONTAINS 12 CHARACTERS.
006300 01  USER-RCD                   PIC X(12).
006400
006400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1          PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2          PIC X.
006800 COPY PLANTS OF COPYLIB.
006900**************************************************************
007000*                 C A L L E D  R O U T I N E S               *
007200*************************************************************
007300*----------  WHO CALL RETURNS USER INFORMATION
007400 01  WHO-PARAMETERS.
007500     05  MOD                   PIC S9(4)                COMP.
007600     05  CAP                   PIC S9(8)                COMP.
007700     05  LATTR                 PIC S9(8)                COMP.
007800     05  USER-NAME             PIC X(8).
007900     05  GROUP-NAME            PIC X(8).
008000     05  ACCOUNT-NAME          PIC X(8).
008100     05  HOME-GROUP            PIC X(8).
008200     05  TERMINAL-NUMBER       PIC 9(2)                 COMP.
008300     05  FILLER                PIC X(2).
008400
008500 COPY TSPLPRT OF COPYLIB.
008600 01  TERM-TYPE                 PIC X(5)     VALUE SPACES.
008700 01  RETURN-CODE               PIC X(2)     VALUE "00".
008800
008900 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.
009000 COPY ESCNAM2 OF COPYLIB.
009100***********************************************************
009200*                    T A B L E S                          *
009300***********************************************************
009400*----------  VALID RECEIVING DEPARTMENTS AND SPOOLER NUMBERS
009500 01  USER-AREA                 PIC X(2400).
009600 01  USER-AREA-RD  REDEFINES USER-AREA.
009700     02  USER-DATA    OCCURS 200 TIMES
009800                      INDEXED BY U-X.
009900         05  USER-NAME-UA      PIC X(8).
010000         05  RCV-DPT-UA        PIC X(4).
010100
010200 COPY DOCKMISC OF COPYLIB.
010500 COPY DBMODES OF COPYLIB.
010600 COPY DBSTAT  OF COPYLIB.
011100 COPY MPLTINFO OF COPYLIB.
011200 COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.
012100 COPY LANGUAGE OF COPYLIB.
012200
012300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
012400 00-MAIN.
012500     PERFORM 100-OPEN-ALL THRU 109-EXIT.
012600     PERFORM 130-INITIALIZATION THRU 139-EXIT.
012700
012800     CALL "SMODFRTS" USING VIEW-COMAREA,
012900                           MISCELLANEOUS-DATA,
013000                           USER-AREA,
013100                           LANGUAGE-PARMS,
013200                           ESC-NAME.
013300
013400     PERFORM 150-CLOSE-ALL THRU 159-EXIT.
013500     GOBACK.
013600
013700 100-OPEN-ALL.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO.
023100     MOVE SPACES TO MISCELLANEOUS-DATA.
           MOVE "MGR     " TO MISC-USER-NAME.
      *----------  FIND THE USER AND SPOOLER NUMBERS
           CALL "TSPLPRT" USING SP-RET-CODE, SP-AREA.
           IF SP-RET-CODE = "NF"
              MOVE "SPOOL KEY NOT FOUND * TMODFRET" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT
           ELSE
           IF SP-RET-CODE NOT = "00"
              MOVE "TSPLPRT ERROR * TMODFRET" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

           MOVE SP-USERNAME        TO MISC-USER-NAME.
           MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (1)    TO SPOOL-PRT-NO.
           MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (2)    TO ACCTG-PRT-NO.
           MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (3)    TO PRINT-PRT-NO.
032500
018900 109-EXIT.  EXIT.
019000 150-CLOSE-ALL.
019100     CLOSE MPLTINFO.
019500 159-EXIT.  EXIT.
019600
019700***********************************************************
019800***********************************************************
019900**    AKRON NEEDS TO VERIFY USERS.  READ IN THE FILE     **
020000**    CONTAING VALID USERS, DEPARTMENTS, AND SPOOLERS.   **
020100***********************************************************
020200***********************************************************
020300 130-INITIALIZATION.
020400*----------  FIND THE PLANT NUMBER
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE "P 01"       TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
033300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
033400           MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO - TDOCKUDC " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
033500           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
033600     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO PLT-NUMBER-PASS.
034100     MOVE SPACES TO USER-AREA.
034110
021000     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO WHICH-PLANT, PLT-NUMBER-PASS.
021100     MOVE SPACES TO USER-AREA.
021200     SET  U-X TO 1.
021300
021400     IF AKRON
021500        OPEN INPUT USER-FILE
021600        GO TO 135-READ-USER-FILE
021700     ELSE
021800        GO TO 139-EXIT.
021900
022000 135-READ-USER-FILE.
022100     READ USER-FILE INTO USER-DATA (U-X)
022200          AT END CLOSE USER-FILE
022300          GO TO 139-EXIT.
022400     SET U-X UP BY 1.
022500     GO TO 135-READ-USER-FILE.
022600 139-EXIT.  EXIT.
022700
022800 990-BLOWUP.
022900     MOVE "TMODFRET"     TO BU-PGM-NAME.
023000     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME    TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
023100     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
023200           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
023300           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
023400 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
